sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant UI as NEW_Frontend
  participant API as FastAPI /api/upload
  participant Store as job_store
  participant Runner as pipeline_runner
  participant Manifest as job_manifest
  participant ASR as ASR stage
  participant Speaker as speaker_analysis
  participant TR as translation router
  participant IT2 as IndicTrans2 worker
  participant QA as QA/integrity layers
  participant Prosody as prosody/HuBERT
  participant Voice as TTS voice router
  participant TTS as XTTS or Sarvam
  participant Media as audio validation + mux
  participant Eval as evaluation/compliance/export artifacts

  UI->>API: POST video, languages, voiceOptions, consent
  API->>Store: create_job(jobId)
  API->>Runner: run_pipeline_background(jobId)
  UI->>API: poll /api/job-status/{jobId}
  Runner->>Manifest: create_manifest + receive_upload
  Runner->>ASR: subprocess asr/run_asr.py
  ASR-->>Runner: ASR JSON with segments/language/diarization metadata
  Runner->>Speaker: optional speaker analysis report stage
  Speaker-->>Runner: speaker reports / voice assignment plan
  Runner->>Prosody: source prosody profile + optional HuBERT features
  Runner->>TR: subprocess translation/run_translate.py
  TR->>IT2: for supported Indic pairs via request JSON
  IT2-->>TR: response JSON translation
  TR->>QA: translation QA + linguistic integrity reports
  TR-->>Runner: translation JSON and reports
  Runner->>Prosody: TTS prosody plan over translation payload
  Runner->>Voice: subprocess tts/run_tts.py
  Voice->>TTS: select XTTS or Sarvam; IndicF5 remains disabled unless explicitly enabled
  TTS-->>Voice: timed WAV segments and final WAV
  Voice-->>Runner: TTS WAV + phonetic report
  Runner->>Media: audio validation, lip-sync or ffmpeg mux
  Media-->>Runner: final MP4
  Runner->>Eval: metrics report + compliance/provenance bundle
  Eval-->>Manifest: artifact registrations
  Runner->>Store: result payload with manifestSummary
  UI->>API: GET /api/result/{jobId}
  API-->>UI: localizedVideos, metricsReport, QA/prosody/compliance summaries

